<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="7" background-color="accent" padding="34pt 12pt 30pt">
      <p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">GOVERNANCE</p>
      <p role="caption">07 / 10</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="53" padding="0">
      <grid spacing="none">
        <grid-item colspan="18" padding="0">
          <ai-image prompt="Editorial studio photograph of a strict vertical hierarchy of warm-white paper trays, an operational-blue decision tab at the top, graphite delivery cards below, one field-sage runbook band and a signal-amber escalation clip, connected by a single precise cord, soft directional daylight, no text, lettering, people, logos, or screens" image-style="operational-still-life" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"/>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="42" padding="32pt 38pt 28pt">
          <labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels>
          <h2>Ways of working: one hierarchy of truth and explicit escalation</h2>
          <grid direction="vertical" marker="number" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" divider="sm neutral-border" style="--marker-inline-size:30pt; --marker-gap:12pt">
            <grid-item padding="9pt 0">
              <h4>Decision log</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Authoritative for accepted choices, rationale, consequences, and superseded decisions.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item padding="9pt 0">
              <h4>Delivery board</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Authoritative for active owner, status, dependency, and target sequence.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item padding="9pt 0">
              <h4>Runbook</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Authoritative for launch, rollback, incident response, and routine operation.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item padding="9pt 0">
              <h4>Chat and meetings</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Coordination only. A decision is not accepted until recorded in the log.</p>
            </grid-item>
          </grid>
          <grid spacing="small">
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <h4>Cadence and change control</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Weekly 30-minute decision forum; twice-weekly delivery review; daily asynchronous update from T+5 through stabilization. Record a proposal for changes to acceptance, data, launch sequence, or more than two business days.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <h4>Escalation and completion</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Escalate access gaps, rehearsal queue age above five minutes, reporting above four hours, or missing authority. Work is done when evidence is attached, the runbook is updated, and the receiver accepts it.</p>
            </grid-item>
          </grid>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>